#   - Index names created by pre-1.0 versions (e.g. "index_allocations_on_tx_and_source_tx")
#     are preserved as-is: renaming indexes on large production tables buys nothing
#     functionally, and pre-1.0 installs may have slightly different names depending
#     on the version they were created with.
#   - Pre-1.0 installs have no foreign key on usage_credits_transactions.wallet_id;
